description = "KH Melon Mix is a fork of melonDS that adapts the Kingdom Hearts Nintendo DS games for a single screen and a regular controller. This core runs the software renderer, so the plugin's single-screen selection and its widescreen rendering are available, but the shader-composited HUD is not."
